OL,3,AEl Salvador sends 2,000 troops to Haiti
OL,4,Ato rescue four missing soldiers
OL,5,
OL,6,FEl Salvador has deployed more than
OL,7,F2,000 soldiers to Haiti as part of a
OL,8,Fmission to retrieve four nationals who
OL,9,Fwent missing in the Caribbean country
OL,10,Falmost two weeks ago.
OL,12,FThe "robust deployment" was
OL,13,Fcommunicated by El Salvador President
OL,14,FNayib Bukele to the Prime Minister of
OL,15,FHaiti Alix Didier Fils-Aime earlier
OL,16,Fthis week, the foreign ministry of El
OL,17,FSalvador said in a statement on
OL,18,FWednesday.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,320,300,200,140,0,100
