OL,3,AEl Salvador sends 2,000 troops to Haiti
OL,4,Ato rescue four missing soldiers
OL,5,
OL,6,FBukele said the soldiers would also
OL,7,Fassist ongoing "security efforts
OL,8,Fagainst gangs in Haiti", the statement
OL,9,Fcontinued.
OL,11,FTensions between the two central
OL,12,FAmerican countries have escalated over
OL,13,Fthe disappearance of the four air force
OL,14,Ftechnicians working as part of a
OL,15,FUN-backed anti-gang organisation in
OL,16,FHaiti.
OL,23,APub: 29-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
